# Only what the build stage copies is sent to the builder: project metadata, lockfile and sources.
# The Dockerfile itself must not be excluded: the Docker CLI tolerates it, but Testcontainers (docker-java), which
# builds this image in the orchestrator's process tests, refuses to build.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
**/__pycache__
